    "not exported": "RHO_BROWSER_PLAYWRIGHT_CLI, PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH, UV_* — the driver is found at rho's own spawn site from RHO_PREFIX; the browsers dir is set inside bin/rho-playwright"
